      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "7E8DF406A5F422DD",
      "text": "When I faced you at the Pokémon League, your\\nstrength was a work in progress—you still held\\r\\npotential that had yet to be fully realized.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
